Z||000005||DRH||09-08-2001||01:12 PM||||Sounds like tranny problems. <P>Have you checked the fluid level in the tranny?<P>Does it only happen when the gas is to the floor? There's a cable that runs from the throttle to the transmission that can cause shifting problems if it's out of adjustment or broken.<P>Does it seem like maybe it's trying to shift to the next gear but doesn't quite make it? Or maybe shifting back and forth between two gears?<P>||||reg||1
